44、CVE-2026-129243、CVE-2026-120705、CVE-2026-129245、CVE-2026-129242。这五个漏洞各自独立，但在默认配置下可被未认证的远程攻击者依次串联利用，构成一条完整的远程代码执行利用链。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qRnjeca6xt9wpHRKEnykbeBvIfQocPTygdSB4lJlgpcniaogvBiaqg7aXnBEbqjE56ic2hob9VQGkiavgQ8OnDsNTzb7qQX2FTY1Fk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-25T05:05:05.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497129:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于PHP反序列化远程代码执行漏洞phpAfterShell（CVE-2026-126714）的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497129&idx=1&sn=a37fd4951cee3b1d6140328ecf1159ad&chksm=cf0245243213efc89dc805fdc27bd1548ee04e1ac1c38a821d449275a8d090872cd3b578c84a&scene=126&sessionid=1795766373#rd","description":"近日，阿尔法实验室监测到PHP官方发布安全更新，修复一处文件session处理器非原子写导致的反序列化漏洞（CVE-2026-126714）。写操作中途被打断时，session文件可残留新旧两段数据的拼接；有合适反序列化gadget链的应用可被远程代码执行。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qT3OE1hTzJpaMF0TlxIhZ9HZsapMqeTU3EXne5IruoH8zOfQEAwrKyXYKpibHnhmHcT53AIOJFOkeNYxUst0ibiaRS1TTj1JkpAak%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T04:09:20.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497123:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于nginx多个远程代码执行漏洞(nginx2root)的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497123&idx=1&sn=cfd39d346153ede80330af078230b598&chksm=cf9d60383f3b5a8e1fcb51fd7c92508b9747298691295c72f45a5b048d671095086582898eaf&scene=126&sessionid=1795766373#rd","description":"近日，天融信阿尔法实验室监测到F5/NGINX官方发布了NGINX Plus和NGINX开源版（NGINX Open Source）的安全更新，修复了5个未经身份验证的远程攻击者可触发的工作进程内存破坏漏洞，可导致敏感信息泄露、拒绝服务或远程代码执行。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qTgiawm0ib2KZHHGUJYzEAErOXUfiaFicvgfVuvOUWhibTM7VCjqYHzGFUm7arFNVwApZvfA4OeiadfOctjLfIGlzyNO2SV1OUZXHBMo%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-19T05:29:06.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497113:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于OpenJDK Base64解码器远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-114938(Java4Shell)的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497113&idx=1&sn=c0de90433b6d9fccf882b656fa96f850&chksm=cf69490816df3669374ae80e85c8ba475161c4dcce4c418ee36c3a34b1a52411a41c0f0b57a2&scene=126&sessionid=1795766373#rd","description":"近日，天融信阿尔法实验室监测到OpenJDK修复了一个远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-114938，该漏洞被称为Java4Shell。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向OpenJDK Base64解码器提交特制输入，触发整数下溢及堆越界写，从而实现敏感信息泄露、拒绝服务或远程代码执行。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qTNMFmCeq28SuwvzF1XYAZVHIoGOHMH6DiceVPpeibTDiboDvXSLPEGkibwnK1kLHP7YiaqUACOOiblgKibiczKDiczzPVbOvx5srYdIHWE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T04:28:30.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497107:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于Apache HTTP Server远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-119618的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497107&idx=1&sn=e7b5c4e9dd5120cb748b91ebfe1bea70&chksm=cfe460d6cdd563ad451d21766af95ac7f39b1b3d8151ee2469d84607753632cb65adda7dde66&scene=126&sessionid=1795766373#rd","description":"近日，阿尔法实验室监测到Apache HTTP Server的HTTP/2模块（mod_http2）存在一处严重的堆破坏漏洞（CVE-2026-119618）。攻击者通过构造并发HTTP/2请求，触发assign_headers()竞态条件，造成堆破坏；Apache与Red Hat将其定为远程代码执行漏洞。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qTIFWUOsJgJbfOVBZKR8aM2z0smuLRSlbnuicekzL6otXbHDSpKrU4T0hHArc0Pu2A87M0J5OYzia9Gq5ia1mqOQTedt9I7T0TicrI%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-13T09:08:33.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497101:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于OpenSSH musl密码认证绕过漏洞CVE-2026-123158的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497101&idx=1&sn=e98d607078b3d6b45215bf751074226a&chksm=cf0d395338d00d1b1aa6bd8bf844d77704d9de19e7aedde204d5f343299bd9a7ab09bcd652d4&scene=126&sessionid=1795766373#rd","description":"天融信阿尔法实验室监测到OpenSSH修复了一个密码认证绕过漏洞CVE-2026-123158，该漏洞被称为sshole。影响由musl libc编译的OpenSSH，远程未授权攻击者无需任何有效凭据即可通过SSH密码认证登录仅允许密钥登录或已锁定密码的账户。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qRHGwhL7ztSlibng9KbOw1e5UWkNOp8mpia1TjtHs7WBmTUwibFEf6dLFYedKs7hwzdLQjtWOYNM9jqTmPrHYx1IOV2mmXYcbuVJQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-06T06:52:03.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497101:2","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于WordPress核心远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-119977的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497101&idx=2&sn=3ee499d893b2da26087356d16e89ce51&chksm=cf9808f6c0a35fc5a1f59c125cd299a53f352bd512134abb649d2d94e87c97e2607b7954ea9c&scene=126&sessionid=1795766373#rd","description":"CVE-2026-119977是WordPress核心中的一个远程代码执行漏洞，无需身份认证、无需用户交互。且已有在野利用证据，风险较高。请所有WordPress用户立即开展排查和处置。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qTia8mLkUo4B5ILj5gNkUqxtcer2VZAoDWAOhBgFJNmtjibvNTGyza0uwjmNyxQ0Z6qnctQNuPR2ZJbVe7THHQLUNMpDB7jwTpwY%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-06T06:52:03.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497092:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于Linux Kernel IPv4 TCP远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-98432)的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497092&idx=1&sn=bd09620dcce63ddc5f2d75b1b8cdb027&chksm=cf5bb683eeb7516bef022fbaf2b3541a09e2a8a305d9ca02e621b14b207038bc510984a32c65&scene=126&sessionid=1795766373#rd","description":"Linux 内核 CVE-2026-98432 远程代码执行漏洞中攻击者可发送特制数据包，无权限获取 root 权限；该漏洞源于 IPv4 TCP 三次握手的竞态条件，利用竞争条件难度较高，目前漏洞细节与 PoC 已公开，部分主流发行版放出补丁，仍建议受影响用户及时做好防御。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qR89XoMgTTxibicibA26K62KOyqjkH0JOKHV4FaxRJnUpxEkAKFqibs3I5KkcfWtPpIspRVEVGmvDQMyJWEF0foYcwtkyGaJeKSbMM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-04T13:36:59.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497087:1","title":"【风险提示】天融信关于Node.js Brotli解码器远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-111497)的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497087&idx=1&sn=8dcdf5d20033d43ab0ae6337b7ae0905&chksm=cfc0c805f428b30b3e7dae183c38ab8b26ff612c92a633feb5cdd1fef67660b4fe25d0c64b22&scene=126&sessionid=1795766373#rd","description":"Node.js内置的 Brotli 解码器存在一个缺陷，在处理格式错误的压缩数据时，可能向内部缓冲区边界之外写入数据。建议所有受漏洞影响版本的用户，立即启动针对该漏洞的防御工作。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qSvnaiaUxZJNicwuOnbKrTha5iaKBHySKukARwwc0icFBaS0YQ66SHUy1Squib7wMOHf75Q6EofbI73e2FxPjAwvHXOFcVliakWy9Niao%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-23T15:53:19.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497078:1","title":"【风险提示】天融信关于PHP远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-109618/CVE-2026-109619(PHP2Shell)的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497078&idx=1&sn=b27d53a738e6e7375ed18aa65f60a4a0&chksm=cff1fc61db46698a5b51491b57c214c36a95bf091bb94c8443fa49f290f63f1c43b90a2eaa04&scene=126&sessionid=1795766373#rd","description":"近日，天融信阿尔法实验室监测到PHP官方发布紧急安全发布预告，PHP核心存在两个严重远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-109618、CVE-2026-109619（社区称PHP2Shell），PHP安全团队对两个漏洞的CVSS v4.0评分均为9.2。请相关用户清查资产，并在补丁发布后第一时间升级。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qSF1B3ibua0GwfG3wngicfxII11xwMb34b8UgJGjuQgl4Z3cKwxYxxU48xFq94zvM6tQRKzxqh7pDRhRhN6YCwwuCGE1ZhaHGBTQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-21T11:14:03.000Z"}]}